  "build": {
    "buildCommand": "cd \"D:/GitHub/Prog Inc\" && npm run build 2>&1 | grep -c \"built in\"; git status --short | grep -v obsidian | cut -c1-60; M=\"C:/Users/Gebruiker/.claude/projects/D--GitHub-Prog-Inc/memory\"; cat > \"$M/skills-web-necklace-layout.md\" <<'EOF'\n---\nname: skills-web-necklace-layout\ndescription: 2026-09-04 Skills page rewrite — necklace-of-clusters radial layout, buy-on-node, measurement harness; what was tried and rejected\nmetadata:\n  type: project\n---\n\nOn 2026-09-04 the Skills web was rebuilt: open clusters (hubs, branch gateways, taps) lay out\non their own and sit on one necklace around You; leaf-only hubs are grids; every purchasable\nnode has a buy button driven by `S.bulk` (`×1/×10/Max` in the zoombar, `B`/`Shift+B`); the\ndetail panel lives in the left column. Left uncommitted for the user (code + PLAN/README/wiki/\nTASKS). Measured: Craft open 2219 → 1470 px, fresh 1143 → 1555 (Foundation is a real circle\nnow), zero overlaps both densities.\n\n**Why:** user asked for a readable, dense, interactive map with buying on it; chose\n\"buy on node\" + \"compact radial\" over clusters-as-blocks or Layers-as-default.\n\n**How to apply:** do not nest cluster circles inside parent circles — tried first, every\nlevel doubled the map (Craft 3051 px). Axis-aligned boxes need diagonal clearance between\nrings (~148 px per tier), so a branch's radial depth is inherent; compactness comes from\npacking angle by `asin(footprint/r)` and from the necklace. Measurement script pattern:\nscratch `measure.cjs` (playwright-core from npx cache + chromium_headless_shell-1223,\n`addInitScript` seeds `zero10x.save.v3` and `zero10x.view.v1`, reads `.treeinner` size and\nnode boxes for overlaps). Open knobs: shape table in `treegraph.ts build()` (Career is a fan),\nunaffordable button shows dim price (`buyLabel` in `treetab.ts`). See [[multipage-refactor-in-progress]].\nEOF\necho \"- [Skills web necklace layout](skills-web-necklace-layout.md) — 2026-09-04 radial rewrite + buy-on-node; rejected approaches and measurement harness\" >> \"$M/MEMORY.md\"\ncat >> \"C:/Users/Gebruiker/.claude/plans/improve-skills-tab-for-wiggly-magpie.md\" <<'EOF'\n\n## Status — 2026-09-04 (complete, uncommitted)\n\nImplemented steps 1–5 with one design change: nested cluster circles (as planned) doubled\nthe map per level, so open clusters are flattened onto **one necklace** around You in tree\norder (see wiki overview \"Density and size\" for the numbers). Buy-on-node, bulk switch,\n`B`/`Shift+B`, tooltips, side detail panel, Layers-mode goTo fix. Build green, stats unchanged.\nEOF\necho done",
